{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_11_level_main_11-06_end",
  "groupId": "main_11",
  "stageId": "main_11-06",
  "title": "Unto the Flood",
  "storyCode": "11-7",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0d888f2e9b891136c7445145d9ee95503a0ab75f98c447fd263880f5a7a8472e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "You saw it, Morgan?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "The guards at the warehouse were so nervous that they didn't even see me coming.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "text": "Alright, alright, you win today. Take your jerky.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "Ha, knew you'd be cross. Next time you can come with, and loser has to keep guard.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "text": "...They're staring at us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "Who?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What are you stari—\nWhat's this about...? Get outta the way, already. I need a drink from the kitchen. Thirsty after all that work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "You shouldn't have done that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "text": "You mean lure away the Sarkaz patrol, giving your people a chance to escape the warehouse?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "Yes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "text": "Funny way to say 'thank you'? Or did I hear you wrong?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "Our comrades in Sudean are grateful, and so are we. The mission went well. But why did you have to burn the warehouse?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "It belonged to a Victorian merchant, not the Sarkaz! The Sarkaz were just occupying it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "Ha. Those fat cats are as cowardly as they are greedy. They want to help the Sarkaz, I'm happy to make them suffer for it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "You do understand that you're just driving them into the arms of the Sarkaz?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "Even better. More than just warehouses to burn for those traitors.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "That's gangster talk, not the way of the Self-Salvation Corps.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "Do you still insist on working with these people, Lady Isabelle?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "text": "My name is Dagda here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "Er...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "It's just, Lady Isa—Dagda. When Lady Allerdale introduced you and Her Highness to us, we thought...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "text": "Siege told you on day one that it was the Glasgow Gang working with the Corps, not Her Highness Alexandrina and the Knight of the Tower.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "Do you really want to see a hoodlum lead us, even take the throne?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "text": "What shit-for-brains gives you the right to say that about Vina?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "Sword back in its place, Morgan! We're on their ground!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "Many of us would rather follow you and Cumberland...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "text": "Stuff it! I-I mean, you've said your piece. As long as we still stand together, you should not speak ill of our fellows.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Self-Salvation Corps Fighter",
      "text": "Sorry, I spoke out of turn.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "text": "You shouldn't have stopped me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "And let you make a mess for Vina to clean up? Not to mention the bunny and the Doctor from Rhodes Island. Next time, think about your company before you lose your head.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "text": "Ha... never thought the day would come that you'd be the one talking to me about losing my head.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "Gotta change, and adapt to the environment. Look how Dagda is doing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "text": "Don't say that, it feels weird.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "You think I wanna congratulate you? Living your way doesn't feel too nice.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "But there's one thing the past couple days've taught me, Morgan. We have to adapt to keep up with Vina.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "text": "...Hmph.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "Here, your jerky. Neither of us won the day.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "text": "Keep it. I've got no appetite.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "text": "I've been thinking, Hannah... is this the kind of life that Vina wants? Since when did nobles and merchants give her the respect she deserves?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "You're not thinking from the right angle.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "They'll realize Vina is a good leader. And the respect Vina gets, she would've earned herself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "Ah, Lady Allerdale! Finally!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "Sorry, I've been busy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "I heard you were looking for a buyer for the Steam Armor?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "...The news reached you quickly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "Only rumors, only rumors. A friend mentioned that a suit of Steam Armor from Londinium might appear on the market.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "But the transaction fell through at the last minute.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "...I see.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "I would not recommend that you sell something so valuable too easily. It's hard to get a good price under current market conditions.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "Thank you for the advice. I'm just trying to do something useful with what little assets my family has left.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "I understand. What little money we have means nothing to the Sarkaz.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "Has the banquet not yet started? There's no need to wait for me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "We can't have that now. You've been the pillar of Central Londinium for ages. It's all thanks to you that we're alive today.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "How is one even supposed to negotiate with a bunch of lunatics who don't care about money?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "You flatter me, sir. I'm just a nobody who spoke up a few times at the unjust treatment that those like you have received.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "Now, now, don't say that. House Cumberland will undoubtedly rise again under your leadership!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Astute Noble",
      "text": "Yes, the past is the past now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Astute Noble",
      "text": "When Londinium knows peace again—not to say that she's not at peace right now, of course!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Astute Noble",
      "text": "In any case, House Cumberland will have our gratitude.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "Lt. Colonel Lettou is here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble & Astute Noble",
      "text": "We salute you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Astute Noble",
      "text": "It's an honor, Lt. Colonel. You have not graced us with your presence for many nights.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Astute Noble",
      "text": "We are most grateful for your efforts to keep the peace!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "I've come into a few bottles of excellent wine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "They may not have been so impressive in the old days, but in times like these they are a rarity. I'll have my butler bring them to your residence.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "Ladies and gentlemen...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "There will be no more banquets, from this day forth.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
      "text": "The Military Commission will be interviewing you soon. Good luck.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "...Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slimy Noble",
      "text": "Wait, no! What do you mean?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Astute Noble",
      "text": "Lt. Colonel Lettou! Lt. Colonel Lettou!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Astute Noble",
      "text": "Lady Allerdale, you must speak to Lt. Colonel Lettou! This is serious! P-People will die!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Astute Noble",
      "text": "Lt. Colonel! Please don't go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ailshie",
      "text": "Miss, this is...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "The Sarkaz have been biding their time. They let these fools wallow in luxury in order to keep the dukes from coming together.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "There is nothing any given duke would like more than to become the master of Victoria.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "At the center of Victorian high society is Londinium, and whomever makes an enemy of Londinium nobility makes an enemy of the entire state.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "Such an offense against Victoria would have forced the dukes to put aside their individual interests and join forces to march on Londinium.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "But the Sarkaz don't care anymore.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "They've achieved their goal.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "Some think what befell Londinium the past few years a disaster. But now—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "War has truly come.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ailshie",
      "text": "What about us, then?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ailshie",
      "text": "Could you talk to Lt. Colonel Lettou, as the nobles suggested? You might...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "They called me 'pillar'. But whom amongst them set foot in Cumberland Manor before the Sarkaz took control of Londinium?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "Which of the Duke's true friends participated in these pretentious banquets?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "I'm simply a figurehead for nobles who lack chips on their side, or those who are trying to protect themselves.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "They flocked to the Cumberland banner, so Cumberland may take the fall for them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ailshie",
      "text": "So what you mean is...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "Let's go, Ailshie. Inform our Self-Salvation Corps and Rhodes Islander friends to evacuate the ducal manor immediately. It is no longer safe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "We'll take one last look at our ancestral home.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Noble?",
      "text": "Allerdale.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Allerdale",
      "text": "You are...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Noble?",
      "text": "A letter from the duke.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
      "text": "A few days in Auchterigg, then Highbury. Look at all those factories and houses packed tight together. Never seen a place so cramped.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Can we go back to Central Londinium after this mission, Captain?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
      "text": "And do what? I don't know what Manfred was thinking, hiring kids like you who've barely taken a life before...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "I'm not a kid! I did a lot of jobs back in Columbia with Grimm, when he was still around!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
      "text": "Grimm, eh...? I have babysit now because he got himself killed in Sudean. I should've taken his head and nabbed the bounty beforehand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Er... weren't you friends?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
      "text": "It's not my job to teach you how to be a mercenary, kid. But it <i>is</i> yours to read the map. Where do we go next?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Munitions Factory No. 11 is just ahead.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "General Manfred gave us a pretty long list... these are all older workers who know something, right? Just take them somewhere with no witnesses and kill them?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
      "text": "I would kill everyone in the factory, if it were up to me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
      "text": "All that crap about killing only the ones who know anything... does he have any idea how much trouble that is?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Paprika",
      "text": "Well, he's the boss.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
      "text": "Whatever. Put away the list and let's go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
      "text": "Feist!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "Patto.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
      "text": "It's been a year. I missed you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "Sorry, I should have tried to send word.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
      "text": "Never mind that. I'm so glad to see you. For the past year, I've been telling everyone that you'd definitely come back alive.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
      "text": "Remember that vent over there? There's a bit of a platform outside the other end of it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
      "text": "A few years ago, you said you would jump off it and onto the factory next door.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
      "text": "We were scared out of our minds. It was what, more than thirty meters off the ground? Fall, and you'd be dead for sure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
      "text": "But you dared to jump. And then... Tommy jumped, Day jumped, and in the end I jumped too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
      "text": "Whenever they ask me if I think you're dead, I tell them to look up at the vent.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "Haha... we weren't afraid of anything, were we?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
      "text": "So these are your Self-Salvation Corps friends?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Hello.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
          "text": "Looks well-read to me.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
          "text": "I heard there were all kinds in the Corps. Guess the rumors are true.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "The Doctor is definitely well-read.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I'm partnered with the Corps.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
          "text": "You have partners?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
          "text": "It's sounding more and more like the real deal, isn't it?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "Haha.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
          "text": "So, why have you come back? Anything I can help with?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "I—",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Patto!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Ca—\nCatherine... I'm sorry."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Get back to work.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
          "text": "Yes, ma'am.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
          "text": "But Feist is back, isn't he? He's not going anywhere?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Don't you worry about him right now. As for your friend, we should talk somewhere else.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
          "text": "Don't blame Catherine, Feist.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
          "text": "She's been protecting us from the Sarkaz for the past year. It's thanks to her that we haven't lost anybody.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
          "text": "There was one time when things got really bad, and she called on the leader of the Defense Forces to mediate.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
          "text": "But the Sarkaz have been putting more pressure on us, on Catherine.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "I know, Patto.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "I don't blame Granny one bit.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "When I joined the Corps and truly understood what I was facing...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "I knew what a difficult decision Granny had to make.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Alright, talk. What did you come back for?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "We're looking for something.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Something?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "Yes. A hidden Sarkaz supply line that's fueling their mad war.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "We're certain the line ends here in the industrial district.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "We need to find it.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Feist says no one knows the district better.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "No one knows the district better than you, Granny. I'm sure you can help.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "That's why I came to you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Flattering me won't do you any good.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "We just need a clue.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "Yes, we won't cause any trouble for the factory.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Why do you think I would help you?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Maybe I already told Patto to call the Sarkaz mercenaries.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "If that's the case... I'll have to flee with the others.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Tell me, how many died in that incident you caused in Sudean?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Do you remember their names? Their faces? Do you remember what they looked like when they died? Their last words?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "I...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Don't rush your answer, Feist. And don't try to bluff your way through it.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "I don't know what this 'Doctor' of yours thinks, but I know you. You think you're smart, but being smart isn't enough to fool death.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
          "text": "Catherine! A bunch of Sarkaz just showed up at the door...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "...?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "Doctor, we need to get out of here—",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Londinium Worker",
          "text": "They say Lt. Colonel Lettou, a Defense Force officer, wants to see you. You're to be escorted.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "...What?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "George, watch these two and make sure they stay put.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Care for a smoke?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
          "text": "Don't bother trying to butter me up.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Lt. Colonel Lettou wants to see me?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
          "text": "Yes.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "We've been meeting our targets. Nothing for him to worry about.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
          "text": "Whatever. He wants to see you. Come with us.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Give me a minute. I have something to take care of first.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
          "text": "We're not asking, old bag.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "I have to put someone in charge. This is very sudden, after all.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "text": "We can wait a little bit... can't we?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Paprika",
          "text": "(Whisper) I don't think the General wants a scene.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary Captain",
          "text": "Ugh. You have ten minutes.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Good enough.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "Granny, why are they looking for you?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "None of your business.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "text": "But—",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Catherine",
          "text": "Shut up and come with me.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
